    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5ba2789cd0159097ef1b526",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "本日的嘉宾！　是赢下春天的『樱花赏』『NHK英里杯』，\n达成史上首次变则二冠的――",
      "source_fingerprint": "dccb810b2fb6b5ded1a2af3c945977f7ab8605ac28822f96ec3516dc611fbee2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
