    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa565e4f4944c82109ce31ef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一开始的时候不是很顺利，渐渐有点衰落了……有一段时间队伍甚至\n落魄到最低限度的队伍人数都集不齐……",
      "source_fingerprint": "901111f1eda97bed1f50e51acaf41896fdc55f3520398824e276413bf4530511",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0202/storytimeline_020202011.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97e049c9f9ecb2d9cab8efa9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是新加入的莱茵力量达成了变则二冠。同样\n是新加入的西沙里奥，目前是『橡树大赛』的有力候补。",
      "source_fingerprint": "866efc40a1a0472f6b426cf578b9b0789f55b5f1aaadc666fa71d1384ea6a4d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0202/storytimeline_020202011.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33b6301997d74927c2c50132",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有了两位新星赛马娘，我们的队伍从一开始的弱小，\n一跃跃进时代的中心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "798027d545cbf0ab53c1af6502d8b068453bd1cf49c4b9b74aa38292505ad5e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0202/storytimeline_020202011.json",
